1
00:00:00,266 --> 00:00:02,436
(Sheldon:)That's ridiculous.

2
00:00:02,435 --> 00:00:03,735
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Why? You never thought

3
00:00:03,737 --> 00:00:05,007
(Raj:)you'd end up in a relationship,

4
00:00:05,004 --> 00:00:06,174
(Raj:)and then you met Amy.

5
00:00:06,172 --> 00:00:07,642
(Raj:)Maybe there's someone else
out there for you.

6
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,780
(Sheldon:)True, but Penny's married,
and so is Bernadette.

7
00:00:12,978 --> 00:00:15,178
(Sheldon:)And your girlfriend has
red hair and white skin,

8
00:00:15,181 --> 00:00:18,351
(Sheldon:)which really rubs up
against my clown phobia.

9
00:00:19,651 --> 00:00:21,251
(Leonard:)Maybe you should consider women

10
00:00:21,254 --> 00:00:22,624
(Leonard:)who aren't
in serious relationships

11
00:00:22,622 --> 00:00:24,192
(Leonard:)with your closest friends?

12
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:27,730
(Sheldon:)There's that prostate doctor,
but I'm still mad at her.

13
00:00:29,928 --> 00:00:31,528
(Sheldon:)Oh, there's a woman.

14
00:00:31,531 --> 00:00:32,931
Oh, I'll make her my girlfriend.

15
00:00:32,932 --> 00:00:35,602
(Raj:)Whoa, whoa.

16
00:00:35,601 --> 00:00:39,741
(Raj:)Walking up to a strange woman
in a bar usually doesn't work.

17
00:00:39,739 --> 00:00:41,639
(Sheldon:)You're forgetting something.

18
00:00:41,641 --> 00:00:43,211
(Sheldon:)Ladies love jocks.

19
00:00:44,109 --> 00:00:46,379
(Raj:)How many sips
of that beer did he have?

20
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:48,249
(Sheldon:)Three.
Oh, boy.

21
00:00:49,881 --> 00:00:54,651
(Sheldon:)Excuse me. I'm recovering
from a recent breakup,

22
00:00:54,654 --> 00:00:58,454
(Sheldon:)and I'm told asking out another
woman might make me feel better.

23
00:00:58,457 --> 00:01:02,657
(Sheldon:)And as Ash Ketchum said
to Pikachu, "I choose you."

